sequenceDiagram
    participant Sender
    participant Router as MailboxRouter (local_core)
    participant Table as OwnershipTable
    participant LocalMailbox as deliver_local
    participant RemoteTransport as deliver_remote (IPC/IPI)
    participant OwnerCore as Owning core's actor

    Sender->>Router: route(actor_id, message)
    Router->>Table: ownerOf(actor_id)
    Table-->>Router: owner_core

    alt owner_core == local_core
        Router->>LocalMailbox: deliver_local(actor_id, message)
        LocalMailbox->>OwnerCore: enqueue into local mailbox
        LocalMailbox-->>Router: true
        Router-->>Sender: Destination.local
    else owner_core != local_core
        Router->>RemoteTransport: deliver_remote(actor_id, message)
        RemoteTransport->>OwnerCore: forward over cross-core transport
        RemoteTransport-->>Router: true
        Router-->>Sender: Destination.remote
    end

    Note over Sender,OwnerCore: If ownerOf() returns null, route() fails fast with ActorNotFound.

    Sender->>Table: (load balancer) chooseCore(descriptor, loads)
    Table-->>Sender: least-loaded core, or pinned_core if set

    Sender->>Table: migration.migrateActor(descriptor, target_core)
    Table->>Table: transfer(actor_id, target_core)
    Table-->>Sender: ownership updated (or PinnedElsewhere / ActorNotFound)
